<h2>Taxi Service Web Application</h2>

<p>
    This web service manages passengers,
    drivers, cars, trips and payments.
</p>

<h3>REST API</h3>

<ul>
    <li>GET /api/passengers</li>
    <li>GET /api/drivers</li>
    <li>GET /api/cars</li>
    <li>GET /api/trips</li>
    <li>POST /api/trips</li>
    <li>PUT /api/trips/:id</li>
    <li>DELETE /api/trips/:id</li>
    <li>GET /api/payments</li>
    <li>POST /api/payments</li>
</ul>